---
import SectionHeading from "./SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 px-6 bg-stone-100/50 dark:bg-stone-900/30">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
    <div class="animate-on-scroll">
      <SectionHeading title="About" />
    </div>

    <div class="animate-on-scroll max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg font-light leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
        Based in Las Vegas, I shoot film because I like the way it makes me slow down.
        Most of what I photograph is the desert — the highways, the light, the quiet
        stretches of nothing that somehow feel like everything. I'm drawn to the space
        between places, the in-between moments that digital tends to rush past.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-6 text-base sm:text-lg font-light leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
        When I'm not out shooting, I work in tech. This site is a place to share what
        I see through the viewfinder.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
